Dialogue: 1,0:00:28.63,0:00:32.47,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,是C-A-P-C-H-A-Bot.cc 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:28.63,0:00:32.47,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,It's C-A-P-C-H-A-Bot.cc.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.58,0:00:38.84,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,它要加载了 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:37.58,0:00:38.84,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,It's gonna load.
