Dialogue: 2,0:00:40.48,0:00:43.10,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,This site has been reported as unsafe.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:44.18,0:00:44.82,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,太棒了 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:44.18,0:00:44.82,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Awesome.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:45.08,0:00:46.30,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这正是我们要找的 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:45.08,0:00:46.30,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,That's what we're looking for.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:46.76,0:00:48.02,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,继续访问不安全的网站 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:46.76,0:00:48.02,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Continue to the unsafe site.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:49.12,0:00:50.54,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,嘿 别这样啊 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:49.12,0:00:50.54,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Hey, come on, man.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.72,0:00:55.06,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,让我访问验证码 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:51.72,0:00:55.06,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Give me the access to the Captcha.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:56.26,0:00:58.60,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我四小时前收到这个 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:56.26,0:00:58.60,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I've been sent this four hours ago,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:58.96,0:01:01.40,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,看起来它已经失效了 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:58.96,0:01:01.40,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,and it seems like it's already dead,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.72,0:01:02.04,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,可能吧 
Dialogue: 2,0:01:01.72,0:01:02.04,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,maybe.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.53,0:01:06.14,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,或者它在检测我用的代理 
Dialogue: 2,0:01:03.53,0:01:06.14,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Or maybe it's detecting the proxy that I'm using.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.77,0:01:10.43,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,哦 等等 
Dialogue: 2,0:01:09.77,0:01:10.43,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Oh, wait.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:10.57,0:01:11.85,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,DNS坏了吗？
Dialogue: 2,0:01:10.57,0:01:11.85,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Did the DNS break?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:17.76,0:01:19.44,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,不 DNS没坏 
Dialogue: 2,0:01:17.76,0:01:19.44,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,No, DNS didn't break.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:28.05,0:01:29.11,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,它在工作 
Dialogue: 2,0:01:28.05,0:01:29.11,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,It's working.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.91,0:01:36.73,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10\pos(1920,2024)}*似了喵*
Dialogue: 1,0:01:36.79,0:01:39.60,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,看来恶意网站现在又上线了 
Dialogue: 2,0:01:36.79,0:01:39.60,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,So it appears the malicious site is back up now.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:40.24,0:01:45.60,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我们要访问的是C-A-P-C-H-A-Bot.cc 
Dialogue: 2,0:01:40.24,0:01:45.60,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,So we're gonna visit it at C-A-P-C-H-A-Bot.cc.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:46.26,0:01:49.16,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,CaptchaBot 但验证码拼错了 
Dialogue: 2,0:01:46.26,0:01:49.16,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,CaptchaBot, but the Captcha is misspelled.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:49.16,0:01:51.04,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,谁在乎呢？
Dialogue: 2,0:01:49.16,0:01:51.04,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Who cares, anyway?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:52.96,0:01:55.46,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,好了 网站被报告为不安全 
Dialogue: 2,0:01:52.96,0:01:55.46,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Alright, the site has been reported as unsafe.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:55.52,0:01:56.52,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我们已经看到了 
Dialogue: 2,0:01:55.52,0:01:56.52,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,We've already seen that.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:57.12,0:01:58.22,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这网站有点问题  
Dialogue: 2,0:01:57.12,0:01:58.22,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,It has some issues.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:02.81,0:02:05.73,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,老兄 我还得为这个假Cloudflare验证码干活  
Dialogue: 2,0:02:02.81,0:02:05.73,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Man, I gotta work for this fake Cloudflare Captcha.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:05.83,0:02:06.59,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,拜托 兄弟  
Dialogue: 2,0:02:05.83,0:02:06.59,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Come on, brother.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.03,0:02:08.87,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,它刚才还能加载  
Dialogue: 2,0:02:08.03,0:02:08.87,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,It just loaded.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:09.67,0:02:11.05,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,就在我开始录屏前  
Dialogue: 2,0:02:09.67,0:02:11.05,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Like, before I started recording,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:11.19,0:02:13.33,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我随手试了个curl请求  
Dialogue: 2,0:02:11.19,0:02:13.33,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I was doing a Hail Mary curl request,
