Dialogue: 2,0:02:18.05,0:02:19.69,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Alright, I'm changing the IP.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:20.49,0:02:22.73,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,OK 我又切了一次IP  
Dialogue: 2,0:02:20.49,0:02:22.73,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Alright, I switched the IP one more time.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:23.15,0:02:24.13,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,再试一次  
Dialogue: 2,0:02:23.15,0:02:24.13,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Let's give this a whirl.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:24.91,0:02:26.05,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,哦 太棒了  
Dialogue: 2,0:02:24.91,0:02:26.05,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Oh, awesome.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:26.79,0:02:28.01,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,终于出来了  
