Dialogue: 1,0:03:36.49,0:03:38.55,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,把这破玩意儿关掉  
Dialogue: 2,0:03:36.49,0:03:38.55,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Turn this crap off.
