Dialogue: 1,0:12:32.16,0:12:32.70,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,成功了  
Dialogue: 2,0:12:32.16,0:12:32.70,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,It worked.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:33.24,0:12:34.82,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,来看看这家伙到底在干嘛
Dialogue: 2,0:12:33.24,0:12:34.82,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,So let's see what this guy does.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:37.32,0:12:38.00,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,PowerShell  
Dialogue: 2,0:12:37.32,0:12:38.00,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,PowerShell.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:38.06,0:12:39.02,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,搜索PowerShell  
Dialogue: 2,0:12:38.06,0:12:39.02,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Search PowerShell.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:39.36,0:12:41.78,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,然后它混淆了字符串  
Dialogue: 2,0:12:39.36,0:12:41.78,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Then it obfuscates the string.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:42.68,0:12:45.12,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,HTTP加S加那部分  
Dialogue: 2,0:12:42.68,0:12:45.12,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,HTTP plus S plus that.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:45.22,0:12:46.60,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,它拼接了字符串  
Dialogue: 2,0:12:45.22,0:12:46.60,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,It concatenates the string.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:47.88,0:12:54.36,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,没错 这就是绕过反恶意软件检测恶意链接的方法之一  
Dialogue: 2,0:12:47.88,0:12:54.36,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,But yeah, that's one of the ways to trick anti-malware into not detecting the malicious links.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:54.54,0:12:56.82,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,通过混淆和拼接字符串  
Dialogue: 2,0:12:54.54,0:12:56.82,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,It's to obfuscate and concatenate the strings.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:57.16,0:12:58.88,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这是其中一种手段  
Dialogue: 2,0:12:57.16,0:12:58.88,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,That's one of the ways.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:58.88,0:13:00.82,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,然后它添加了链接  
Dialogue: 2,0:12:58.88,0:13:00.82,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,And it just adds the link.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:04.64,0:13:08.66,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这里又有一段混淆代码  
Dialogue: 2,0:13:04.64,0:13:08.66,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,And then another bit of obfuscation here.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:13.42,0:13:15.54,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,它创建了一个对象  
Dialogue: 2,0:13:13.42,0:13:15.54,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,It creates an object.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:15.90,0:13:18.58,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,对 我猜就是下载可执行文件然后运行  
Dialogue: 2,0:13:15.90,0:13:18.58,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I think it just downloads an executable and then runs it.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:18.82,0:13:20.24,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,至少原理是这样  
Dialogue: 2,0:13:18.82,0:13:20.24,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Well, that's the idea anyway.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:21.52,0:13:23.20,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我有点不敢运行  
Dialogue: 2,0:13:21.52,0:13:23.20,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I am afraid to run it,
Dialogue: 1,0:13:23.32,0:13:24.26,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,但还是试试吧  
Dialogue: 2,0:13:23.32,0:13:24.26,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,but let's do it.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:26.08,0:13:28.46,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,天啊 这看起来太可怕了  
Dialogue: 2,0:13:26.08,0:13:28.46,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Oh God, this looks horrendous,
Dialogue: 1,0:13:28.56,0:13:30.54,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,不过还是通过运行窗口执行吧  
Dialogue: 2,0:13:28.56,0:13:30.54,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,but let's do it via the run box.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:31.08,0:13:31.38,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,确定  
Dialogue: 2,0:13:31.08,0:13:31.38,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:31.82,0:13:33.80,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我要...我要规范化操作  
Dialogue: 2,0:13:31.82,0:13:33.80,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna... I'm gonna make it canonical.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:35.24,0:13:36.26,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,看看会发生什么  
Dialogue: 2,0:13:35.24,0:13:36.26,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,See what it does.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:43.23,0:13:47.63,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,事实证明现在网上充斥着这类虚假的程序  
Dialogue: 2,0:13:43.23,0:13:47.63,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Apparently, I've been proven right now that there's an abundance of these fake captures.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:48.35,0:13:50.29,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,只是我不知道怎么找到它们  
Dialogue: 2,0:13:48.35,0:13:50.29,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I just don't know how to find them.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:52.53,0:13:53.99,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,真的什么都没发生？  
Dialogue: 2,0:13:52.53,0:13:53.99,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,It really does nothing?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:54.15,0:13:54.59,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,什么？  
Dialogue: 2,0:13:54.15,0:13:54.59,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:54.71,0:13:55.19,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,不可能  
Dialogue: 2,0:13:54.71,0:13:55.19,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:55.59,0:13:56.23,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,肯定...  
Dialogue: 2,0:13:55.59,0:13:56.23,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,It must be...
Dialogue: 1,0:13:59.03,0:14:00.55,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,为什么它会自动关闭？
Dialogue: 2,0:13:59.03,0:14:00.55,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Why does it self-close?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:01.75,0:14:03.41,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,启动PowerShell  
Dialogue: 2,0:14:01.75,0:14:03.41,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Let's start PowerShell.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:08.62,0:14:10.44,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,天啊 别这样  
Dialogue: 2,0:14:08.62,0:14:10.44,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Oh my god, come on.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:11.30,0:14:12.84,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,哦 它在下载一个txt文件  
Dialogue: 2,0:14:11.30,0:14:12.84,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's downloading a txt file.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:12.96,0:14:13.44,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,是啊 当然  
Dialogue: 2,0:14:12.96,0:14:13.44,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:13.76,0:14:13.98,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,当然  
Dialogue: 2,0:14:13.76,0:14:13.98,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:14.26,0:14:17.34,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,然后大概会把t替换成e之类的  
Dialogue: 2,0:14:14.26,0:14:17.34,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,And then it's probably like replacing t's with e's.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:18.34,0:14:20.18,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,某种类似的替换操作  
Dialogue: 2,0:14:18.34,0:14:20.18,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Some kind of thing like that.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:22.08,0:14:24.10,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,$c是个变量  
Dialogue: 2,0:14:22.08,0:14:24.10,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,$c, that's a variable.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:24.32,0:14:27.46,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我们...来还原混淆字符串  
Dialogue: 2,0:14:24.32,0:14:27.46,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Well, let's... let's restore the obfuscated string.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:28.04,0:14:28.74,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这还挺有意思  
Dialogue: 2,0:14:28.04,0:14:28.74,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,That's kind of fun.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:29.90,0:14:30.92,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,等等 什么？  
Dialogue: 2,0:14:29.90,0:14:30.92,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:31.70,0:14:33.28,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,哦 刚才卡了一下  
Dialogue: 2,0:14:31.70,0:14:33.28,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Oh, it just lagged for a bit.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:34.94,0:14:36.70,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我们快速反混淆一下  
Dialogue: 2,0:14:34.94,0:14:36.70,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Let's deobfuscate that real quick.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:38.99,0:14:41.58,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,阿里巴巴巴巴  
Dialogue: 2,0:14:38.99,0:14:41.58,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Alibabababa.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:42.96,0:14:44.44,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,等等 阿拉巴巴  
Dialogue: 2,0:14:42.96,0:14:44.44,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Wait, alabababa.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:44.66,0:14:45.02,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,抱歉  
Dialogue: 2,0:14:44.66,0:14:45.02,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:53.52,0:14:54.34,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,kh在哪？  
Dialogue: 2,0:14:53.52,0:14:54.34,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Where's kh?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:58.48,0:15:00.24,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,哦 kh等于那个加b  
Dialogue: 2,0:14:58.48,0:15:00.24,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Oh, wait, kh is that plus b,
Dialogue: 1,0:15:00.56,0:15:04.56,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,也就是双斜杠加$c  
Dialogue: 2,0:15:00.56,0:15:04.56,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,which is the double slash plus $c,
Dialogue: 1,0:15:04.92,0:15:07.70,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,也就是cvg加后面那些  
Dialogue: 2,0:15:04.92,0:15:07.70,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,which is cvg plus all that.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:18.68,0:15:19.52,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,i是什么？  
Dialogue: 2,0:15:18.68,0:15:19.52,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,What is i?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:19.66,0:15:22.92,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,i已经是...可执行脚本的一部分  
Dialogue: 2,0:15:19.66,0:15:22.92,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,i is already... it's a part of the executable script.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:26.26,0:15:27.92,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,哦 没了  
Dialogue: 2,0:15:26.26,0:15:27.92,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's gone.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:28.32,0:15:29.50,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,是吗？  
Dialogue: 2,0:15:28.32,0:15:29.50,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Is it?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:29.56,0:15:31.79,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,阿拉巴巴巴巴
Dialogue: 2,0:15:29.56,0:15:31.79,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Alababababa.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:32.34,0:15:33.62,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,所以才会失败  
Dialogue: 2,0:15:32.34,0:15:33.62,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,This is why it's failing.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:33.94,0:15:34.40,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,好吧  
Dialogue: 2,0:15:33.94,0:15:34.40,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Okay, yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:35.30,0:15:44.02,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这些虚假验证页面正是通过这类花招来绕过反病毒检测  
Dialogue: 2,0:15:35.30,0:15:44.02,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,But yes, this is another tricky kind of thing that these fake captures employ to avoid anti-malware detection.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:46.97,0:15:49.45,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这是个假冒的Cloudflare验证  
Dialogue: 2,0:15:46.97,0:15:49.45,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and that's a fake Cloudflare capture.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:49.57,0:15:51.17,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这个假得太明显了  
Dialogue: 2,0:15:49.57,0:15:51.17,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,This one is not plausible at all.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:51.17,0:15:53.64,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,不过之前那个验证机器人页面做得还挺像样的
Dialogue: 2,0:15:51.17,0:15:53.64,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,The capture bot one was pretty good, though.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:53.79,0:15:55.03,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这点得承认  
Dialogue: 2,0:15:53.79,0:15:55.03,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna give them that.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:58.03,0:15:59.71,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,放进运行框里  
Dialogue: 2,0:15:58.03,0:15:59.71,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Put that in the run box.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:01.55,0:16:05.05,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,发现是相同IP相同端口相同文件  
Dialogue: 2,0:16:01.55,0:16:05.05,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Find out it's the same IP and the same port and the same file.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:05.87,0:16:07.77,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这下可以结案了  
Dialogue: 2,0:16:05.87,0:16:07.77,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,And we can be done with that.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:08.29,0:16:10.21,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,感谢观看 保重
Dialogue: 2,0:16:08.29,0:16:10.21,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Thanks for watching and take care.
